WEBVTT

00:23:59.850 --> 00:24:01.007
the inequality balance.

00:24:01.007 --> 00:24:02.589
BG: That's the most important.

00:24:02.589 --> 00:24:06.137
(Applause)

00:24:06.137 --> 00:24:09.552
CA: Well, I really think that most people here

00:24:09.552 --> 00:24:11.297
and many millions around the world

00:24:11.297 --> 00:24:13.846
are just in awe of the trajectory

00:24:13.846 --> 00:24:15.154
your lives have taken

00:24:15.154 --> 00:24:18.885
and the spectacular degree to which

00:24:18.885 --> 00:24:21.000
you have shaped the future.

00:24:21.000 --> 00:24:22.340
Thank you so much for coming to TED

00:24:22.340 --> 00:24:23.801
and for sharing with us and for all you do.

00:24:23.801 --> 00:24:25.737
BG: Thank you.
MG: Thank you.

00:24:25.737 --> 00:24:28.524
(Applause)